{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08693","headline":"商山四皓 · 李白","name":"商山四皓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发四老人，昂藏南山侧。\n偃卧松雪间，冥翳不可识。\n云窗拂青霭，石壁横翠色。\n龙虎方战争，於焉自休息。\n秦人失金镜，汉祖昇紫极。\n阴虹浊太阳，前星遂沦匿。\n一行佐明圣，倏起生羽翼。\n功成身不居，舒卷在胸臆。\n窅冥合元化，茫昧信难测。\n飞声塞天衢，万古仰遗则。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}